{"ref":"BDB, שִׁקֵּץ","hw":"שִׁקֵּץ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקֵּץ</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pi.</strong>  <strong> denom. detest, make detestable</strong>;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקַּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:25\" href=\"/Psalms.22.25\">ψ 22:25</a>; Impf. 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׁקְּצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.13\">Lv 11:13</a> +, etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁקֵּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.26\">Dt 7:26</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>detest</em>, c. acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.26\">Dt 7:26</a> (Impf. + Inf. abs.; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּעֵב תְּתַעֲבֶנּוּ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.11\">Lv 11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.13\">13</a> (P); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:25\" href=\"/Psalms.22.25\">ψ 22:25</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>make detestable</em>, obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַפְשֹׁתֵיכֶם</span> (= reflex.) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.43\">Lv 11:43</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.25\">20:25</a> (H).","next":"BDB, שִׁקּוּץ","prev":"BDB, שֶׁ֫קֶץ"}